---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ShopScene from '../../components/ShopScene.astro';
import Week1Tool from '../../components/Week1Tool.astro';

const rungs = [
  { letter: 'A', label: 'Meet your thought partner', active: true },
  { letter: 'B', label: 'Learn when to trust it', active: false },
  { letter: 'C', label: 'Put it to work', active: false },
  { letter: 'D', label: 'Make it permanent', active: false },
];

const bring = [
  'Whatever the AI tool handed you when you ran the prompt above',
  "One real AI conversation from the past week, if you've got one, good or bad",
  'Your laptop or phone, logged into whichever tool you use',
];
---

<Base title="Team training, Week 1: Prove it" description="Week 1 of team AI training. Find out what is already working, then build a prompt for your role in under a minute.">
  <section class="container hero">
    <div class="intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Team training · Week 1 of 6</p>
      <h1>Prove it</h1>
      <p class="subhead">Before we teach anything, let's find out what's already working. No lesson today: just an honest look at where you stand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="scene">
      <ShopScene name="biology" alt="Jeff in a hard hat teaching at a chalkboard beside a desk with a microscope." />
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container guide">
    <div class="ladder">
      {
        rungs.map((rung) => (
          <div class:list={['rung', 'depth-box', { active: rung.active }]}>
            <span class="num">{rung.letter}</span>
            <span class="label">{rung.label}</span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <section class="panel depth-box">
      <h2>Here's the thing</h2>
      <p class="lede">Some of you already use AI every week. Some of you tried it once and stopped. So this week isn't a lesson; it's an audit. We're going to find out what actually stuck, in front of everyone, with zero shame attached.</p>
      <p>If you've been using AI every week, you'll get to show that off. If you haven't touched it in months, that's useful information too, for you and for the team. Either way, nobody's behind. We're just starting from the truth instead of the assumption.</p>
      <div class="callout">
        <strong>The only prep that matters:</strong> come with one real thing AI has done for you this week. If you can't think of one, the tool below builds a prompt for you in under a minute.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel depth-box">
      <h2>Before you show up: run this</h2>
      <p>Most people freeze when you ask "how could AI help you at work?" That's not a you problem: it's a blank page problem. Nobody brainstorms well from nothing. So don't try. Pick your role below, copy the prompt it builds, and paste it into Claude or ChatGPT. It'll ask you a few quick questions about your actual week, then hand you three specific things worth trying, ranked by how much time they'd likely save you.</p>
      <Week1Tool />
    </section>

    <div class="pair">
      <section class="panel depth-box">
        <h2>What to bring to Session 1</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          {
            bring.map((item) => (
              <li>
                <span class="check-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>{item}</span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="panel teaser depth-box">
        <p class="eyebrow">Coming in Week 2</p>
        <h3>Why you'll stop repeating yourself</h3>
        <p>The prompt above works, but notice it had to ask you a bunch of questions it shouldn't need to ask twice. Next week we fix that: you\'ll build a stored context file so a new conversation can start already knowing you. Twenty minutes to set up, and most of the re-explaining stops.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p class="sign-off"><span>AI the vL Way · Team training</span> <span>Less hype. More help.</span></p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    padding-top: var(--space-7);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--cognac-dark);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .subhead {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .scene {
    min-width: 0;
    border: 4px solid var(--navy);
  }

  .guide {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .ladder {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .rung {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: var(--space-3);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
  }

  .num {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--warm-grey);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .rung.active {
    background: var(--cognac-dark);
    border-color: var(--cognac-dark);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .rung.active .num {
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .rung.active::after {
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--cognac-light);
    content: 'You are here';
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .panel {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
    border-top: 6px solid var(--cognac-dark);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .callout {
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    background: var(--cognac-light);
    border-left: 6px solid var(--cognac-dark);
  }

  .callout strong {
    color: var(--cognac-dark);
  }

  .pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .checklist {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .checklist li {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cream);
  }

  .checklist li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .check-mark {
    flex: 0 0 22px;
    height: 22px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .teaser {
    background: var(--cognac-light);
  }

  .teaser p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sign-off {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
    color: var(--warm-grey);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero,
    .pair {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: var(--space-6);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .ladder {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .panel {
      padding: var(--space-4);
    }
  }

  @media print {
    :global(.site-header),
    :global(.site-footer),
    .scene {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
